# os/live-build/config/package-lists/metaos.list.chroot -- OS-008.
#
# The os/packages.txt set as real Debian package names, plus the
# META_OS.md spec extras. Name set frozen by OS-010 first light:
# this list must match packages.txt entry for entry. This list is
# a name list only, exactly like packages.txt: versions pin under
# OS-010 against a built image's package list, not here. The
# mapping from the spec descriptions to package names: python3 +
# venv becomes python3-venv, redis client tools become
# redis-tools, fonts become fonts-dejavu, chromium stays chromium,
# openssh-server stays openssh-server, qemu-guest-agent stays
# qemu-guest-agent. openssh-server ships present but disabled by
# default, matching the primary image; enabling it is a runtime
# decision, not a build default.
systemd
systemd-sysv
udev
dbus
linux-image-amd64
initramfs-tools
python3
curl
ca-certificates
iproute2
git
python3-venv
redis-tools
chromium
fonts-dejavu
openssh-server
qemu-guest-agent
